Mod names
---------

Mod names throughout the masterlist, the reference catalogues and the submitted
corpus belong to their authors. They are reproduced exactly as written, because
they are matched against what players have installed and altering them breaks
the match.


Submitted load orders
---------------------

Files under "Load Orders - Public Submitted" were contributed by players who
chose to make them public. They are lists of mod names and identifiers rather
than creative work, and they exist so the sorter can learn from real,
played-on orders.
